<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysian Pacific year net up 7.0 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysian Pacific year net up 7.0 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30, 1997</p>
<p>		     (In million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		100.14	 vs	   93.80</p>
<p>    Shr	    (cents)   47.8	  vs	   45.3</p>
<p>    Dividend   (percent)   25.0	  vs	   20.0</p>
<p>    Turnover		1,039.44	 vs	  882.47</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	  145.67	 vs	  134.76</p>
<p>    Minorities	 less  40.01	 vs   less  37.46</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries  less   3.98	 vs   less   8.89</p>
<p>NOTE - Malaysian Pacific Industries Bhd, a member of Hong Leong group, is involved in manufacture of fibreboard cartons, electronic components and colour scanning services.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
</text>
